{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_36aa835eccbeb33de090fd1f65b020c4fd5dcf74b5e29ce602d8ee9541f9a189"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Arctic runs locally and connects directly to the AI provider, storing conversations on the device; it collects anonymous telemetry that can be disabled with `arctic telemetry disable`."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5c7feda44509064245b8bfd1c02d82823e959cd96ed24a6b71140f919da096ce"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Arctic can import existing Claude Code and OpenCode configuration, including custom commands, agents from ~/.claude/agents/, and MCP servers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_75fb28875c3b4d5ff1f6b6d49361396a282f997681e36df9c5e5cf1fea0273af"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product tracks real-time usage across coding plans, supports multiple accounts per provider, and allows switching models mid-conversation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_911156b2441482c831399754fd6d9e680fe03f40a9dabb74fcb44d9690b329ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"API-key support is documented for OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Perplexity, Openrouter, Ollama, and more."},{"claim_ids":["clm_98dcd33969fd5bc2764bd01a70073c184fd0439c9fb9a471540fb3e5148a7a76"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Arctic provides a terminal UI launched with the `arctic` command after a shell-script install and sourcing the shell config."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9b1c718baee70fd4ae25bdbb3b8dd15815a0ad70b63f7bc3c6b38f58825ecd84"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A `arctic telemetry status` command reports the current telemetry state."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f45e44376081066ce05d24b04aaad65cf5bc56b68a3725465c607dc7147669e6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Supported coding-plan providers include Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, Z.AI, Kimi, Amp Code, Qwen Code, and MiniMax."}],"claim_ids":["clm_36aa835eccbeb33de090fd1f65b020c4fd5dcf74b5e29ce602d8ee9541f9a189","clm_5c7feda44509064245b8bfd1c02d82823e959cd96ed24a6b71140f919da096ce","clm_75fb28875c3b4d5ff1f6b6d49361396a282